cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Analysis code for archaeal MAGs from the deep Gulf of Mexico
message: If you use this code, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Castañeda-Martínez
    given-names: Rubén
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9272-7968"

    affiliation: >-
      Centro de Investigación Científica y de Educación Superior de Ensenada
      (CICESE)
version: "0.0.1"
repository-code: https://github.com/ruben1294/gom-archaeal-mags
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Pipeline and analysis code for 54 archaeal metagenome-assembled genomes from
  six stations and three depths in the deep Gulf of Mexico. Covers quality
  assessment, GTDB taxonomic classification, functional annotation with DRAM2
  and eggNOG-mapper, marker-based phylogenomics, ANI, chimerism screening, and
  anvi'o pangenomics across the species with enough genomes to support it.
keywords:
  - archaea
  - metagenome-assembled genomes
  - Gulf of Mexico
  - phylogenomics
  - pangenomics
  - functional annotation
  - Poseidoniales
  - Nitrososphaerales
